  "title": "Bit Digital Reaffirms Long-Term Investment in WhiteFiber Shares",
  "summary": "Bit Digital, Inc. (Nasdaq: BTBT), today reaffirmed its long-term investment in WhiteFiber, Inc. (Nasdaq: WYFI) and confirmed that it will not sell any of its WhiteFiber shares in any secondary offering or other discretionary disposition during 2026.",
